      "type": "ona-read-more-content",
      "name": "Read more content",
      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p>At ONA Coffee, we believe that great coffee starts with great preparation. Our brew guide coffee directory can help you pull optimal espresso shots, perfect a pour-over or experiment with cold brew. Each coffee brewing guide provides step-by-step instructions to make every cup taste its best. </p><p>Developed by ONA’s award-winning baristas and coffee educators, these recipes reflect the same precision and passion we apply at our cafés and training facilities.</p><h2>Who our coffee brew guides are for</h2><p>Our brew guides for coffee are designed for home brewers of all levels. Whether you’re a beginner learning the fundamentals or an experienced coffee enthusiast chasing the perfect extraction, our detailed instructions help you brew confidently at home.</p><h2>What you’ll learn</h2><p>Each coffee-making guide covers different brewing styles and coffee types, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Espresso </strong>— Dial in your grind, dose and yield for consistent, balanced shots.</li><li><strong>Filter coffee </strong>— Master pour-over and batch brew for clarity and sweetness.</li><li><strong>Cold brew </strong>— Learn how to brew refreshing coffee that’s smooth and low in acidity.</li><li><strong>Specialty methods </strong>— Discover how to brew with AeroPress, Syphon or other creative tools.</li></ul><h2>Why use a brew guide?</h2><p>Even small changes in grind size, water temperature or brew time can dramatically alter your coffee’s flavour. Our brew guide coffee series removes the guesswork, offering reliable recipes tested by professionals so you can consistently recreate the flavours you love.</p><p>We also share insights from our team on topics like <a href=\"https://onacoffee.com.au/blogs/news/how-to-store-and-use-frozen-coffee\">how to store and use frozen coffee</a>, helping you protect freshness and elevate your coffee preparation from bean to cup.</p><h2>Start brewing better coffee</h2><p>Browse all ONA Coffee brew guides and experiment with your favourite beans from <a href=\"https://onacoffee.com.au/collections/all\">our online shop</a>.</p>",
